<Base title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
<Fragment set:html={"<section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/resources/\">Resource Center</a> / Building Planning Guides</div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Appalachian Sheds Inc.</div><h1>24 guides. Every major building decision.</h1><p>Start with the property. Then choose purpose, construction, budget and final project readiness.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#all-resources\">Browse all 24 topics</a><a class=\"btn secondary\" href=\"/options-upgrades/\">Explore Options &amp; Upgrades</a></div></div></section><section class=\"wide\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"section-title\"><h2>Six decisions, made in the right order.</h2><p>Begin wherever you are in the planning process.</p></div><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"tile\"><span class=\"number\">STAGE 01</span><h3>Property &amp; Site</h3><p>5 practical homeowner guides</p><a class=\"action\" data-scroll=\"Property &amp; Site\" href=\"#all-resources\">Browse related guides \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\"><span class=\"number\">STAGE 02</span><h3>Size, Use &amp; Design</h3><p>5 practical homeowner guides</p><a class=\"action\" data-scroll=\"Size, Use &amp; Design\" href=\"#all-resources\">Browse related guides \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\"><span class=\"number\">STAGE 03</span><h3>Structure &amp; Construction</h3><p>3 practical homeowner guides</p><a class=\"action\" data-scroll=\"Structure &amp; Construction\" href=\"#all-resources\">Browse related guides \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\"><span class=\"number\">STAGE 04</span><h3>Budget &amp; Buying</h3><p>4 practical homeowner guides</p><a class=\"action\" data-scroll=\"Budget &amp; Buying\" href=\"#all-resources\">Browse related guides \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\"><span class=\"number\">STAGE 05</span><h3>Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership</h3><p>4 practical homeowner guides</p><a class=\"action\" data-scroll=\"Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership\" href=\"#all-resources\">Browse related guides \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\"><span class=\"number\">STAGE 06</span><h3>Final Readiness &amp; Process</h3><p>3 practical homeowner guides</p><a class=\"action\" data-scroll=\"Final Readiness &amp; Process\" href=\"#all-resources\">Browse related guides \u2192</a></article></div></div></section><section class=\"wide\" id=\"all-resources\" style=\"background:#eae8e2\"><div class=\"shell\"><div class=\"section-title\"><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color:#896747\">Complete directory</div><h2>24 Building Guides</h2><p>Search by topic or narrow the list by decision category.</p></div><div class=\"control\" role=\"search\"><input aria-label=\"Search resource articles\" id=\"resource-search\" placeholder=\"Search titles and planning topics\" type=\"search\"/><select aria-label=\"Filter by category\" id=\"resource-category\"><option value=\"\">All topics</option></select></div><p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"muted\" id=\"results-count\"></p><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{const i=document.querySelector('#resource-search'),s=document.querySelector('#resource-category'),cards=[...document.querySelectorAll('.tile[data-filter]')],count=document.querySelector('#results-count');if(!i||!s)return;const cats=[...new Set(cards.map(c=>c.dataset.category))];cats.forEach(c=>{let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=c;o.textContent=c;s.append(o)});function update(){let n=0;for(let c of cards){let v=c.dataset.filter.includes(i.value.trim().toLowerCase())&&(!s.value||c.dataset.category===s.value);c.hidden=!v;c.style.display=v?'':'none';if(v)n++}count.textContent=n+' resources displayed'}i.addEventListener('input',update);s.addEventListener('change',update);update()});</script><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Property &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"backyard building site preparation guide property &amp; site learn what the building area should look like before\n              construction and what site conditions deserve attention\n              early.\"><span class=\"number\">01 \u00b7 Property &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-site-preparation-guide/\">Backyard Building Site Preparation Guide</a></h3><p>Learn what the building area should look like before\n              construction and what site conditions deserve attention\n              early.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-site-preparation-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Property &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"backyard building permits, zoning &amp; setbacks guide property &amp; site understand the local rules that may affect placement,\n              size, property-line distances and project approval.\"><span class=\"number\">02 \u00b7 Property &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-permits-zoning-and-setbacks-guide/\">Backyard Building Permits, Zoning &amp; Setbacks Guide</a></h3><p>Understand the local rules that may affect placement,\n              size, property-line distances and project approval.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-permits-zoning-and-setbacks-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Property &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"backyard building foundation options guide property &amp; site compare common foundation approaches and understand why\n              soil, grade, drainage and the intended building use\n              matter.\"><span class=\"number\">03 \u00b7 Property &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-foundation-options-guide/\">Backyard Building Foundation Options Guide</a></h3><p>Compare common foundation approaches and understand why\n              soil, grade, drainage and the intended building use\n              matter.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-foundation-options-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Property &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"backyard building moisture protection &amp; ground contact guide property &amp; site learn how ground conditions, drainage and moisture\n              management can affect the life of a backyard building.\"><span class=\"number\">04 \u00b7 Property &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-moisture-protection-and-ground-contact-guide/\">Backyard Building Moisture Protection &amp; Ground Contact Guide</a></h3><p>Learn how ground conditions, drainage and moisture\n              management can affect the life of a backyard building.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-moisture-protection-and-ground-contact-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Property &amp; Site\" data-filter=\"backyard building access planning guide property &amp; site check gates, side yards, slopes, overhead obstacles,\n              material routes and the working space around the building.\"><span class=\"number\">05 \u00b7 Property &amp; Site</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-access-planning-guide/\">Backyard Building Access Planning Guide</a></h3><p>Check gates, side yards, slopes, overhead obstacles,\n              material routes and the working space around the building.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-access-planning-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Size, Use &amp; Design\" data-filter=\"choosing the right size guide size, use &amp; design think through present needs, future needs, usable space\n              and common size mistakes before choosing width \u00d7 length.\"><span class=\"number\">06 \u00b7 Size, Use &amp; Design</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/choosing-the-right-size-guide/\">Choosing the Right Size Guide</a></h3><p>Think through present needs, future needs, usable space\n              and common size mistakes before choosing width \u00d7 length.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/choosing-the-right-size-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Size, Use &amp; Design\" data-filter=\"backyard building use case planning guide size, use &amp; design define what the building needs to accomplish before\n              settling on its size, openings, layout and features.\"><span class=\"number\">07 \u00b7 Size, Use &amp; Design</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-use-case-planning-guide/\">Backyard Building Use Case Planning Guide</a></h3><p>Define what the building needs to accomplish before\n              settling on its size, openings, layout and features.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-use-case-planning-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Size, Use &amp; Design\" data-filter=\"backyard building customization planning guide size, use &amp; design understand which design choices affect appearance,\n              function and long-term usefulness.\"><span class=\"number\">08 \u00b7 Size, Use &amp; Design</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-customization-planning-guide/\">Backyard Building Customization Planning Guide</a></h3><p>Understand which design choices affect appearance,\n              function and long-term usefulness.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-customization-planning-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Size, Use &amp; Design\" data-filter=\"roof pitch selection guide size, use &amp; design compare roof slopes and understand how roof pitch affects\n              appearance, interior volume and the character of the\n              building.\"><span class=\"number\">09 \u00b7 Size, Use &amp; Design</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/roof-pitch-selection-guide/\">Roof Pitch Selection Guide</a></h3><p>Compare roof slopes and understand how roof pitch affects\n              appearance, interior volume and the character of the\n              building.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/roof-pitch-selection-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Size, Use &amp; Design\" data-filter=\"standard features vs optional upgrades guide size, use &amp; design separate what is included from what costs extra so you can\n              compare buildings and proposals more accurately.\"><span class=\"number\">10 \u00b7 Size, Use &amp; Design</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/standard-features-vs-optional-upgrades-guide/\">Standard Features vs Optional Upgrades Guide</a></h3><p>Separate what is included from what costs extra so you can\n              compare buildings and proposals more accurately.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/standard-features-vs-optional-upgrades-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Construction\" data-filter=\"materials &amp; construction standards guide structure &amp; construction understand the major structural materials and construction\n              details that deserve attention when comparing backyard\n              buildings.\"><span class=\"number\">11 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Construction</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/materials-and-construction-standards-guide/\">Materials &amp; Construction Standards Guide</a></h3><p>Understand the major structural materials and construction\n              details that deserve attention when comparing backyard\n              buildings.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/materials-and-construction-standards-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Budget &amp; Buying\" data-filter=\"payment, deposits &amp; financing options guide budget &amp; buying understand common payment stages, deposits and financing\n              considerations before committing to a project.\"><span class=\"number\">12 \u00b7 Budget &amp; Buying</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/payment-deposits-and-financing-options-guide/\">Payment, Deposits &amp; Financing Options Guide</a></h3><p>Understand common payment stages, deposits and financing\n              considerations before committing to a project.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/payment-deposits-and-financing-options-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Construction\" data-filter=\"scheduling &amp; what to expect on build day structure &amp; construction learn what should happen before the crew arrives and what\n              homeowners can reasonably expect during construction.\"><span class=\"number\">13 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Construction</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/scheduling-and-what-to-expect-on-build-day/\">Scheduling &amp; What to Expect on Build Day</a></h3><p>Learn what should happen before the crew arrives and what\n              homeowners can reasonably expect during construction.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/scheduling-and-what-to-expect-on-build-day/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Structure &amp; Construction\" data-filter=\"built-on-site construction guide structure &amp; construction understand why constructing the building at your property\n              can change access, customization and the overall building\n              process.\"><span class=\"number\">14 \u00b7 Structure &amp; Construction</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/built-on-site-construction-guide/\">Built-On-Site Construction Guide</a></h3><p>Understand why constructing the building at your property\n              can change access, customization and the overall building\n              process.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/built-on-site-construction-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership\" data-filter=\"electrical, hvac &amp; utility-ready planning guide utilities, finish &amp; ownership think ahead about electricity, heating, cooling and other\n              utilities before walls, finishes and surrounding site work\n              make changes more difficult.\"><span class=\"number\">15 \u00b7 Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/electrical-hvac-and-utility-ready-planning-guide/\">Electrical, HVAC &amp; Utility-Ready Planning Guide</a></h3><p>Think ahead about electricity, heating, cooling and other\n              utilities before walls, finishes and surrounding site work\n              make changes more difficult.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/electrical-hvac-and-utility-ready-planning-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership\" data-filter=\"interior finish packages guide utilities, finish &amp; ownership understand how a weather-tight building shell can be\n              planned for a more finished backyard office, studio,\n              hobby or flexible-use space.\"><span class=\"number\">16 \u00b7 Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/interior-finish-packages-guide/\">Interior Finish Packages Guide</a></h3><p>Understand how a weather-tight building shell can be\n              planned for a more finished backyard office, studio,\n              hobby or flexible-use space.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/interior-finish-packages-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership\" data-filter=\"ownership \u2014 warranty, maintenance &amp; long-term care utilities, finish &amp; ownership learn what to expect after construction and which\n              maintenance habits can help protect the building over\n              time.\"><span class=\"number\">17 \u00b7 Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/ownership-warranty-maintenance-and-long-term-care/\">Ownership \u2014 Warranty, Maintenance &amp; Long-Term Care</a></h3><p>Learn what to expect after construction and which\n              maintenance habits can help protect the building over\n              time.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/ownership-warranty-maintenance-and-long-term-care/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Final Readiness &amp; Process\" data-filter=\"neighborhood fit, hoa &amp; property aesthetics guide final readiness &amp; process consider neighborhood appearance, hoa requirements and how\n              the building will visually relate to your home and\n              property.\"><span class=\"number\">18 \u00b7 Final Readiness &amp; Process</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/neighborhood-fit-hoa-and-property-aesthetics-guide/\">Neighborhood Fit, HOA &amp; Property Aesthetics Guide</a></h3><p>Consider neighborhood appearance, HOA requirements and how\n              the building will visually relate to your home and\n              property.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/neighborhood-fit-hoa-and-property-aesthetics-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Budget &amp; Buying\" data-filter=\"how to evaluate a backyard building company budget &amp; buying compare builders using construction details, scope,\n              communication, warranties and other information that can\n              be checked before you decide.\"><span class=\"number\">19 \u00b7 Budget &amp; Buying</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/how-to-evaluate-a-backyard-building-company/\">How to Evaluate a Backyard Building Company</a></h3><p>Compare builders using construction details, scope,\n              communication, warranties and other information that can\n              be checked before you decide.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/how-to-evaluate-a-backyard-building-company/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Final Readiness &amp; Process\" data-filter=\"project readiness roadmap final readiness &amp; process review the major decisions together and identify anything\n              that should be resolved before the project moves toward\n              construction.\"><span class=\"number\">20 \u00b7 Final Readiness &amp; Process</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/project-readiness-roadmap/\">Project Readiness Roadmap</a></h3><p>Review the major decisions together and identify anything\n              that should be resolved before the project moves toward\n              construction.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/project-readiness-roadmap/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Budget &amp; Buying\" data-filter=\"pre-purchase checklist budget &amp; buying use one final review to confirm the important details\n              before approving the building and moving forward.\"><span class=\"number\">21 \u00b7 Budget &amp; Buying</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/pre-purchase-checklist/\">Pre-Purchase Checklist</a></h3><p>Use one final review to confirm the important details\n              before approving the building and moving forward.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/pre-purchase-checklist/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership\" data-filter=\"backyard building value impact guide utilities, finish &amp; ownership consider the practical ways a well-planned backyard\n              building may improve usefulness, organization and property\n              appeal.\"><span class=\"number\">22 \u00b7 Utilities, Finish &amp; Ownership</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-value-impact-guide/\">Backyard Building Value Impact Guide</a></h3><p>Consider the practical ways a well-planned backyard\n              building may improve usefulness, organization and property\n              appeal.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-value-impact-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Budget &amp; Buying\" data-filter=\"expanded buyer faq \u2014 tough questions budget &amp; buying review questions homeowners may hesitate to ask but should\n              understand before choosing a backyard building company.\"><span class=\"number\">23 \u00b7 Budget &amp; Buying</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/expanded-buyer-faq-tough-questions/\">Expanded Buyer FAQ \u2014 Tough Questions</a></h3><p>Review questions homeowners may hesitate to ask but should\n              understand before choosing a backyard building company.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/expanded-buyer-faq-tough-questions/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article><article class=\"tile\" data-category=\"Final Readiness &amp; Process\" data-filter=\"backyard building process guide final readiness &amp; process see how the major planning, buying, site and construction\n              decisions fit together from the beginning of the project\n              through completion.\"><span class=\"number\">24 \u00b7 Final Readiness &amp; Process</span><h3><a href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-process-guide/\">Backyard Building Process Guide</a></h3><p>See how the major planning, buying, site and construction\n              decisions fit together from the beginning of the project\n              through completion.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/planning-guides/backyard-building-process-guide/\">Read guide \u2192</a></article></div></div></section><section class=\"wide\"><div class=\"shell visual\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color:#896747\">Your next best decision</div><h2>Choose the building around the work it needs to do.</h2><p>Start with use, site and budget; then choose size, roofline, openings, finishes and future improvements in the right order. Your written proposal should make included features and optional work clear.</p><a class=\"btn light\" href=\"/buildings/\">View Models &amp; Pricing</a></div><img alt=\"Appalachian Sheds Carriage Lane backyard building\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/models/carriage-lane.jpg\"/></div></section>"} />
